# Services & API

- Singleton domain services in `src/services/domains/<domain>/`; React Query hooks in `hooks/`.
- Paths only via `API_ADDRESS` in `src/services/common/apiAddress.ts`.
- Success with body: unwrap `TResponse<T>.data`. Success 204 / empty 200: no `data` expected.
- Auth header: Bearer access token. On 401 with a prior token, refresh via bare axios (not `axiosInstance`) then retry; pass `salonId`/`branchId` from `useSalonContextStore` on refresh.
- `switch-context` replaces the access token; `salonId: null` exits to customer/global mode.
- ID mapping: public browse Guids ≠ long IDs for create/favorites/finance. Booking create body is `{ salonId, branchId?, startTime, notes?, services: [{ offeringId, staffId }] }`.
- Favorites CRUD uses numeric `salonId` (`POST/DELETE /api/favorites/{salonId}`); resolve via `resolveNumericSalonId` from detail when present.
- Online booking browse: branch services / available-dates / staff-availability / calculate-price / `GET /api/salons/available-slots`. Create needs long `offeringId` + `staffId` — enrich via salon-offerings + staff-for-offerings (`booking-mappers.ts`). Exit salon JWT context before create.
- Customer appointments: `GET /api/appointments/me`, `GET .../me/{id}`, `POST .../{id}/cancel` (Scheduled only). UI under `/reservation` and `/reservation/[id]`.
- Reviews: create/edit/delete + public list by numeric `salonId`. Track customer submission via `useMyReviewsStore` + `GET /api/reviews/{id}` for pending badge. Salon reports: `POST /api/salon-reports`.
- Subscriptions: plans/me/entitlement/trial/checkout. Gate salon create with `useSubscriptionEntitlement().canCreateSalon` (entitled && under maxSalons). Checkout creates Pending platform invoice (no PSP yet).
- Onboarding: `/onboarding` — 7-step save-* + submit-for-review; draft in `useOnboardingDraftStore` (salonPublicId). New create blocked without entitlement; resume draft allowed.
- Owner daily board: use salon-context JWT + `GET /api/appointments?date=yyyy-MM-dd` (and optional salon/branch/staff filters), group by `AppointmentStatus`; lifecycle calls are `check-in`, `complete`, `no-show`, `cancel`.
- Salon-side quick booking uses `POST /api/appointments/quick-book` with phone/fullName/branch/startTime/services; keep `offeringId` and `staffId` numeric.
- Customers scaffold is `GET /api/customers` (search + pagination) and stays service-only until dedicated UI is requested.
- Catalog owner module uses `api/catalog` as source of truth (replace legacy `api/salon-offering` for dashboard operations): offerings CRUD, `PATCH .../active`, staff-centric `GET/PUT /api/catalog/staff/{staffMemberId}/services`, and pricing-rules CRUD.
- Staff schedules use `api/working-schedules` (weekly) and `api/special-schedules` (specific date overrides/off days).
- Finance domains: `api/invoices`, `api/payments`, `api/wallets`, `api/tips`, `api/reports/z-report`. Always send a unique `idempotencyKey` on payment create.
- Owner finance flow: issue invoice from Completed appointments (`POST /api/invoices/from-appointment/{appointmentId}`), then record payment method (Cash/Card/Online/Transfer/Wallet).
- Customer wallet UI must use real wallet endpoints (balance + transactions), no crypto/mock fields.
- Owner ops phase-10: payouts/earnings (`api/earnings`, `api/payouts`), commission plans (`api/commission/plans*`), and notifications inbox (`api/notifications`).
- Admin-only actions/surfaces (review moderation, salon approval workflows, platform subscription mark-paid, admin trust actions) are out of scope in this SPA.
- Shared domain enums live in `src/services/common/enums/domain-enums.ts`.
- Contract source of truth: `docs/FRONTEND_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`.
